# External API Application Rules

- Depend on `IExternalDataService` only; never reference provider/infrastructure types.
- Keep handlers thin: validate input, call service, map to DTO, return result.
- No direct `HttpClient` usage in Application.
- No hardcoded endpoint URLs or retry/caching logic in handlers.
- Keep external response contracts mapped explicitly to Application DTOs.
